  as an SOP (OPEN-04).
- **Risk acceptability — severity (S):**
  - S1 Negligible
  - S2 Minor (temporary/reversible)
  - S3 Serious (medical intervention required, reversible)
  - S4 Critical (permanent impairment)
  - S5 Catastrophic (death)
- **Probability (P):** P1 Improbable · P2 Remote · P3 Occasional · P4 Probable · P5 Frequent
- **Acceptability matrix (5×5):**
  - Low (S×P ≤ [FILL IN]): broadly acceptable
  - ALARP (mid band): reduce as far as reasonably practicable + document benefit-risk
  - Unacceptable (S×P ≥ [FILL IN]): must reduce or redesign
  - ⚠️ Provisional thresholds — management ratification [QMS] required (OPEN-02)

